WEBVTT

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:54.460
Level 8 test! Level 8 test! Level 8 test!

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:01.550
That was close...

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:04.180
Doremi, for your level 8 exam...

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:06.390
...you failed!

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:19.740
Just a dream...?

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:28.500
Everyone Fails!? The Level 8 Exam.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:34.460
Great, now it's all clean and beautiful.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:36.590
Not a single speck!

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:40.170
Doremi fell!

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:41.640
She did.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:44.600
Stop talking about me falling!

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:52.480
~ Farewell to all your troubles.
Let's go to the forest with creeks! ~

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:54.820
This is a great reel, very slippery.

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:56.150
Slippery!

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:57.710
She slipped.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.300
She did.

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:00.150
She slipped, she did.

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:03.280
Slipped?

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:05.480
I'm gonna slide down!

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:06.460
Slide down!

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:07.390
I'm gonna slide down!

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:08.460
Slide down!

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:09.300
I slid down.

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:10.580
You did! You did!

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:14.670
Fall down!

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:15.170
It fell.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:18.010
Ah, it fell.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:24.930
The level 8 exam seems pretty easy.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.850
Yeah, if ya study for it.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:30.070
So you don't have to be nervous.

00:03:30.070 --> 00:03:31.980
I don't want to fail.

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:35.770
You dropped something!

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:42.660
Fujiwara, perfect score!

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:45.020
Great job, keep up the good work!

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:46.530
Thank you, I shall!

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:50.750
Senoo, it'll be difficult to do business with a score like this.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:54.460
If it was about money, then there'd be no problem.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:55.840
And Harukaze...

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.420
With this score, I'll see you again in 3rd grade next year.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:01.300
That means...

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:03.060
I...

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:04.140
must...

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:07.310
repeat?

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:10.680
Harukaze?

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:14.690
I was just joking. Get a hold of yourself.

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:16.860
Harukaze Doremi!

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:20.190
Teacher, now ain't a good time to joke about that.

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:23.430
Doremi-chan has to take the level 8 test today.

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:25.910
Level 8 test... for what?

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:27.370
Aah, that's...

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:28.580
A-Abacus!

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:32.040
Right,right, in abacus, teacher!

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:35.790
Since when did Doremi start learning how to use an abacus?

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:38.210
Just recently.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:40.910
Right, right, we're learnin' it together.

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:41.880
Right?

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:45.380
We'll take her to the nurse.

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:47.320
Go ahead.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:48.590
A'ight, we're goin'.

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:50.100
Doremi-chan, hang in there.

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.520
Doremi using an abacus?

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.830
It was just a dream?

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:14.790
I dreamt I had to repeat a grade for getting 20 points on my test.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:21.130
Oh, you're awake.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:23.050
Yuki-sensei!

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:29.100
You were talking in your sleep about failing your level 8 exam for abacus. You sounded worried.

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:30.350
Abacus?

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:32.770
Oh, er, well...

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:35.600
Long ago, I was like that too.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:36.310
Eh?

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:37.400
Yuki-sensei too?

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:40.600
Anyone would.

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:46.820
But unlike you, Doremi-chan, I felt lucky that time.

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:48.870
Lucky?

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:53.540
They say reality and dreams are the opposite of one another.

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:59.420
If I had a bad dream, I always thought it'd be the opposite in real life.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.840
I was glad to have a bad dream, so I was lucky.

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:05.630
I see.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:07.930
Doremi-chan's dream is the opposite of reality too.

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:10.600
You always fear the worst in your dreams.

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:14.060
In reality, if you work hard, it will be alright.

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:15.600
You're right.

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:20.150
Alright, I'll ace that level 8 exam! I'll...

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:23.060
I'll do my best!

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:24.900
Yuki-sensei, thank you!

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:27.190
Good luck!

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:31.410
Alright!

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:47.880
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:49.970
What was that?

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:51.590
Come in!

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.100
What was that sound?

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:55.470
Dunno...

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:58.260
Just my imagination?

00:06:58.260 --> 00:06:59.140
Good night.

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:02.900
Good night.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:15.910
See you, Dodo!

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:18.080
I'm off!

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:46.820
My level 8 exam was to see if I could ride a broom.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:48.950
That was a long time ago, right?

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:51.680
How rude! It was only 300 years ago.

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:53.200
So which is it?

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:56.330
But if that was the case, this'll be easy.

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:58.400
Yer so different from earlier.

00:07:58.400 --> 00:08:01.960
This time maybe Doremi-chan can pass along with us.

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:05.670
Well, if you relax, then you don't have anything to worry about.

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:07.460
We've been waiting.

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:08.800
Good afternoon!
We've been waiting.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:10.460
Good afternoon!

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:19.590
No way! The same test like at school?

00:08:19.590 --> 00:08:21.020
No way!

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:22.230
No waaaay!

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:24.000
What's the meaning of this?

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.650
It's not a test.

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:27.360
It's a questionnaire.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:34.280
It's because you have to work together for some time until you pass the level 1 exam.

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:39.290
Yes, so we'd like to get to know you more.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:42.400
So that's it. What a relief!

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:43.750
About us, y'say?

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:47.850
So please write down the thing you hate most.

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:49.090
Write it down.

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:49.960
Alright!

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:52.170
M-a-t-h.

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:54.130
G-h-o-s-t-s.

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:56.550
Takoyaki.

00:08:58.010 --> 00:08:59.310
Alright. Okay.

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:02.610
Today's exam problem is...

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:03.310
Yes?

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:09.600
By the lake on the foothill of Mt. Fail...

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:11.770
On the head of the 10-legged-thing...

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:13.820
Plant this flag...

00:09:14.480 --> 00:09:16.110
You only have three hours...

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:18.110
Question, please!

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:19.740
What's a 10-legged-thing?

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:22.580
That... is a secret.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:23.650
Right?

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:24.330
Right!

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.280
What? No way!

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:27.880
I ain't heard of somethin' like that.

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:30.380
It sounds like it could be French.

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:32.900
This is the first time I've heard of something like that too.

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:34.050
Yeah.

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:36.130
Don't mistake it...

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:38.220
...with an 8-legged-thing.

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:40.540
I'm getting even more confused.

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:42.560
Thinking doesn't help either.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:44.060
Right, well in that case...

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.680
We're off!

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:50.860
Good luck! Be sure to pass the exam!

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:54.400
First...

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:56.320
...is this!

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:12.040
It's such a hot and humid and uncomfortable forest.

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:15.580
Feels like some ghosts are gonna pop out.

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:16.670
G-G-Ghosts?

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:20.510
Gho-gho...

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:22.000
Hadzuki-chan?

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:22.850
What is it?

00:10:23.810 --> 00:10:26.810
I'm afraid of ghosts.

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.730
There ain't no such thing!

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:36.820
Revenge...

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:07.090
That scared me!

00:11:07.090 --> 00:11:08.140
Are they gone?

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:09.190
Hadzuki-chan?

00:11:09.190 --> 00:11:09.810
What?

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:13.780
Did ya write 'ghost' in yer questionnaire?

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:14.610
Yeah.

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:16.980
I thought so.

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:18.150
They're comin' back!

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:20.740
You two, be ready to use magic!

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:27.110
Revenge...

00:11:27.110 --> 00:11:29.210
Did you want something?

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:33.130
Ghosts!

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:38.460
Ah, they're pretty good.

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:41.550
Then, next is this...

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:43.470
What is it this time?

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:45.010
I hope they'll be alright.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:11.410
The ghosts turned tail after seein' other ghosts!

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:13.800
That was hilarious!

00:12:13.800 --> 00:12:17.170
Ai-chan, you said something about the questionnaire?

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:22.130
I think the obstacles are gonna be what we wrote earlier.

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:23.590
Ehhhhhh!!!?

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:25.550
No way!

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:27.600
Doremi-chan, what'd ya write?

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:30.680
Err, I wrote 'math'...

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:35.480
Come, come, it's time for a math test!

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:37.020
Yaaaaaaah!

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:40.820
Come, sit! Sit!

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:43.540
Why'd ya write 'math!?'

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:45.910
But, they said it was only a questionnaire!

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:49.860
You can't go further unless you get more than 70 points, understand?

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:51.220
Ehhhhh!?

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:52.880
Okay, let's begin!

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:54.160
This isn't fair!

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:55.120
Ready!
This isn't fair!

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:58.750
No way! What's this?

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:01.920
We ain't been taught any of this!

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:05.220
Not fair! This is cruel!

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:09.560
Good thing I studied.

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:13.520
That's it!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:15.060
With magic...

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:16.440
we can become Hadzuki-chan!

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:20.730
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:25.900
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:29.240
Become Hadzuki-chan!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:36.750
Let's do it!

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:47.840
Level 9 witch apprentices can change their appearances, but not their brains.

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:51.140
Done!

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:57.020
Ah! A UFO!

00:13:58.100 --> 00:13:59.440
No way! You serious? Where? I want to see!

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:01.270
Doremi-chan!

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:03.360
Where is it? I want to see!

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:06.490
I didn't get to see it at all!

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:09.480
Maybe it was just my imagination.

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:09.950
Alright...

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:11.950
There it is again!

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:15.950
No way! Really? Where? You serious?

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.120
That's cheating!

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:21.940
That's cheating alright.

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:24.430
In a magic exam, anything goes!

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:27.970
That's right! Even using magic like that is alright!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:30.470
Oh, fine!

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:32.890
The last one is this...
Takoyaki

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:39.810
Good-bye!

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:48.950
They said it was a questionnaire!

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:52.320
Jeez! That was cruel!

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:53.080
Agreed!

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.490
Ai-chan, what did you write?

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:58.910
It's too terrible, I can't say it.

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.060
Huh? Something smells good.

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:01.880
You're right.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:03.340
Takoyaki

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:05.710
Hi, we meet again.

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:07.720
Takoyaki?

00:15:07.720 --> 00:15:11.590
That's right! If you don't eat, the 10-legged-thing won't appear.

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:15.680
Oh-no, even though I hate it, I gotta eat it.

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:17.270
Ai-chan, since when did you...

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:18.600
Jus' shut up an' eat!

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:21.730
Well, I'll leave it to the octopus, Hachitaro-san.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:23.560
Heya, thanks for waiting!

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:26.320
Delicious!

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:28.440
This is the most delicious I've ever eaten!

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:31.690
I really hate it, but I gotta admit it's delicious!

00:15:31.690 --> 00:15:33.240
More please!

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:37.080
Huuuuh?

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:41.290
I was afraid something like this would happen, so I wrote the opposite.

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.880
That's our Ai-chan!

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:46.910
Brilliant!

00:15:46.910 --> 00:15:49.210
One more dish, please!

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:53.510
Sorry, but we're out.

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:54.930
What about these?

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:58.890
These are.... These are for my beloved Surumeko-chan.

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:01.060
Surumeko-chan?

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:02.950
She's a female squid.

00:16:02.950 --> 00:16:03.890
Squid?

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:06.360
An octopus fell in love with a squid?

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:07.980
That's right!

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:10.280
I love Surumeko-chan!

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:11.400
But...

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:18.580
But in this lake, the octopus family and the squid family are enemies from long ago.

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:20.620
Surumeko-chan!

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:23.710
<i>We told you not to do this, you fool!</i>

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:25.920
Hachitaro-san!

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:31.760
What are you doing with that female squid?

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.330
Chief!

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:35.220
Please forgive me.

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:38.060
I love Surumeko-chan.

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:41.980
Surumeko-chan wanted to eat my takoyaki.

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:43.980
You insolent fool!

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:50.910
From then on, we haven't seen each other since.

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:54.400
My chief's magic prevents me from swimming.

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:58.240
I'm over here, while Surumeko-chan is beyond the lake.

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:02.870
That is such a sad story.

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:07.910
All I wish for is that at least the smell could reach her...

00:17:07.910 --> 00:17:10.840
...the smell of the takoyaki I make everyday.

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:12.970
Surumeko-chan...

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:14.680
That's so sad.

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:17.470
I wish we could do something.

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:19.750
Yeah, but we ain't got the time.

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:22.310
We gotta find the 10-legged-thing.

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:25.020
It's time to use Magical Stage!

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:25.980
You're right!

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:27.190
Alright!

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:29.940
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:34.820
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:39.030
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:42.580
Magical Stage!

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:53.380
Let Hachitaro-san and Surumeko-san meet!

00:17:57.840 --> 00:17:58.570
A swim ring...?

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:00.650
Nothin' happened.

00:18:00.650 --> 00:18:01.890
But...

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:03.140
There's a red thread.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:08.390
Perhaps, Surumeko-chan is on the other end.

00:18:08.390 --> 00:18:09.660
I see!

00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:11.280
It's possible.

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:13.570
Alright, I'll check it out!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:18.160
Octopus jump!

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:35.750
Surumeko-chan...

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:37.510
Hachitaro-san!

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:39.930
Alright!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.990
I missed you, Hachitaro-san!

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:45.180
Me too, Surumeko-chan!

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:47.310
I love you!

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:49.650
I got your 8 legs.

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:51.900
And I got your 10 legs!

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:54.820
10 legs?

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:57.900
She has 10 legs.

00:18:57.900 --> 00:18:59.530
She's the 10-legged-thing!

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:02.300
An octopus has 8 legs.

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:05.470
They said not to mistake it for something 8-legged!

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:06.700
I see!

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:18.800
That is the tragic tale of an octopus and a squid.

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:23.640
We're sorry, but we have to leave now.

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:26.210
We did it!

00:19:26.210 --> 00:19:27.930
Mission completed!

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:31.730
We failed?

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:36.210
Right. What a pity, time was up.

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:39.120
You were three seconds late.

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:40.650
That's not fair!

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:44.160
Dang it, that's why I told you to mind your own business!

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:47.390
But we felt sorry for them, is all.

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:48.670
Stupid!

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:53.670
Think about yourselves before others, you stupid Ojamajo!

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:00.590
That's...

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:19.400
That's... no way!

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:20.900
What is it?

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:26.830
Her Majesty!!

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:30.790
Did you say Her Majesty!?

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:35.460
The Queen of the Witch World!

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:38.590
I'd like to meet her.

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:41.760
What kinda person is she?

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:06.450
I was watching.

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:11.080
These children helped two lovers to meet.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:14.120
That is why they ran out of time.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:17.920
For that reason, I ask that you let them pass.

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:20.130
Really?

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:23.460
If Her Majesty says so...

00:21:23.460 --> 00:21:26.090
...then the three of you pass.

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:28.760
Alright!

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:31.430
We did it!

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:33.560
Alright!

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:43.110
Thank you!

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:45.550
Thank you, Your Majesty!

00:21:45.550 --> 00:21:46.530
Thanks!

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:55.530
We passed level 8!

00:21:55.530 --> 00:21:56.500
Congratulations!

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:03.170
A young girl's heart is hurt.

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:04.920
A splendid birthday.

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:07.470
And a pretty one-piece dress.

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:08.840
Sagawa-kun.

00:22:08.840 --> 00:22:11.510
Making fun of her was really cruel!

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:15.060
If you want forgiveness, you have to make Okuyama-san laugh from her heart!

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:18.310
Even if y'say that, no one would laugh seein' Sagawa-kun's act.

00:22:18.310 --> 00:22:20.020
But we don't know that for sure.

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:20.770
What?

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:22.520
A-Are you serious, Hadzuki-chan?

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:24.530
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:24.530 --> 00:22:25.820
Laugh and Forgive Me!?

00:22:26.400 --> 00:22:28.990
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
